  "notes": "FORMS:\n- Adverbial: ねむたく\n- Negative: ねむたくない\n- Past: ねむたかった\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {眠|ねむ}い: sleepy (standard form)\n- ねむたい: sleepy (variant, slightly more colloquial)\n\nBoth have the same meaning. {眠|ねむ}い is the standard dictionary form and more widely used. ねむたい is heard more in casual speech and in certain regional dialects (especially Kansai).\n\nWRITING:\nCan be written as {眠|ねむ}たい. The kanji form {眠|ねむ} is the same as in {眠|ねむ}い.",
